{title: 070 - Praise Ye the Father}
{subtitle: SDA Hymnal #070 • }
{lyricist: }
{composer: }
{key: Ab}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{meta: hymn_number 70}
{meta: category Trinity - }

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Fm/C]Praise ye the [Bbm/Db]Father [Cm]for [Fm/C]His [Db]lovingkindness,
[Ab]Tenderly [Cm]cares [Fm/C]He for [Bbm/Db]His [Fm/C]erring [Ab]children;
[Bbm]Praise Him, ye [Ab]angels, [Bbm]praise [Eb/Bb]Him [Db/Ab]in [Cm/G]the [Ab]heavens;
[Fm/C]Praise ye [Eb/Bb]Jeho [Fm/C]vah!
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[Fm/C]Praise ye the [Bbm/Db]Savior, [Cm]great [Fm/C]is [Db]the [Bbm/Db]compassion,
[Ab]Graciously [Cm]cares [Fm/C]He for [Bbm/Db]His [Fm/C]chosen [Ab]people;
[Bbm]Young men and [Ab]maidens, [Bbm]ye [Eb/Bb]old [Db/Ab]men [Cm/G]and [Ab]children,
[Fm/C]Praise ye [Eb/Bb]the Savior!
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[Fm/C]Praise ye the [Bbm/Db]Spirit, [Cm]comforter [Bbm/Db]of [Fm/C]Israel,
[Ab]Sent of the [Cm]Father [Fm/C]and [Bbm/Db]the [Fm/C]Son to [Ab]bless us;
[Bbm]Praise ye the [Ab]Father, [Bbm]Son, [Eb/Bb]and [Db/Ab]Holy [Ab]Spirit,
[Fm/C]Praise the [Eb/Bb]Eternal [Fm/C]Three!
{end_of_verse}
